DESCRIPTION:Although we are primarily a Live Music Calendar\, we often come across Electronic & DJ events in the area and list them for you as we find out about them. Please verify the DJ\, times and cover charges with the venue. \nPritchard Park Music & Makers Series – 5-8pm (through August) \nThe Exchange Patio at The Restoration Hotel – 5:30-7;30pm \nThe Whale West Asheville – 6-9pm \nEda Rhyne Distilling – 6-9pm \nPotential New Boyfriend – 7-10pm \nLazy Diamond – 10pm-2am \nThe Double Crown – 10pm-2am \nCheck with the for DJs and covers.
