SUMMARY:Gospel Night presents: Manifestation of the Carolinas
DESCRIPTION:Thursday July 30 | 9pm | $10 \n\n\n\n\n\n\nManifestation of the Carolinas\, from Fairmont\, NC is known for their contributions to gospel music. They blend traditional gospel sounds with contemporary influences\, appealing to a wide audience. \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\nThe Double Crown – Great vibes\, great bourbon\, and great music! (21+ only\, dog friendly) A West Asheville institution\, the Double Crown hosts Western Wednesdays\, karaoke\, DJ’s and rousing Gospel & Soul night’s each month. It’s a great place for an intimate evening of dancing\, drinks and fun\, especially if you love a good dive bar.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/gospel-night-presents-manifestation-of-the-carolinas/
LOCATION:The Double Crown West Asheville\, 375 West Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Manifestationweb-e1784823926901.jpg
GEO:35.5780389;-82.5787972
