CREATED:20250902T165309Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T120648Z
UID:10020513-1785520800-1785528000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Clouds Of Delusion | Fridays In The RAD Music Series
DESCRIPTION:We have as amazing show lined up for this Friday evening featuring Clouds of Delusion. Show starts at 6pm. Great music\, delicious food and cold beverages.\nFree of everyone and everyone welcome! \nClouds of Delusion is an Asheville based Grateful Dead tribute band consisting of high level jazz trained musicians. They are heavily inspired by the music of the Grateful Dead and enjoy showing their love for the music by playing it with their own flare and high energy jams. \nRecords in the RAD in the River Arts District is a thoughtfully curated record store with an eclectic selection of vinyl\, both new and used. In addition to records\, we also have a music inspired art gallery\, which features artwork from Brian\, Dylan and Susan Haynes. recordsintherad.com \nAt Wedge Brewing\, we got our start in the River Arts District\, and therefore hold art and community very close to us. We create beer for the creatives and give them a place to commune. wedgebrewing.com \n \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/clouds-of-delusion-fridays-in-the-rad-music-series/
LOCATION:Records in the RAD/The Wedge
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Screenshot-2026-07-29-080218-e1785326649189.png
END:VEVENT
